# Manifest for `scripts/build_partner_pack.sh`.
#
# Format:
#   - Blank lines and `#`-prefixed lines are ignored.
#   - Each non-comment line names a repo-relative file to include in the pack.
#   - Use `src/path => 01_renamed.md` to rename inside the pack (handy for
#     ordering files alphabetically).
#   - Everything below a single `---` line becomes the README footer
#     (after the auto-generated provenance + table-of-contents header).
#
# Example:
#   docs/foo.md
#   docs/bar.md => 02_bar.md
#   ---
#   ## Reading order
#   Start with `foo.md`, then `02_bar.md`.

docs/example_doc.md

---
## Reading order

(Free-form Markdown footer appended after the auto-generated header.)
